tes, discover 120+ quirky panda names that capture your panda&#x27;s unique personality.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/funny-betta-fish-names-inspired-by-sports-150-funny-ideas-for-your-betta-fish/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🐟</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Betta Fish Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Funny Betta Fish Names Inspired by Sports: 150+ Funny Ideas for Your Betta Fish</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Looking for funny betta fish names? Discover 150+ funny ideas inspired by sports for your beloved betta fish companion.</p></a></div></section><nav class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\" aria-label=\"Post navigation\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-left\" href=\"/blog/food-drink-inspired-pet-names/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">← Previous Post</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">Food and Drink Pet Names: 150+ Delicious Ideas for Your Tasty Companion</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-right\" href=\"/blog/ocean-marine-pet-names-sea-creatures/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Next Post →</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">Ocean and Marine Pet Names: 120+ Ideas from the Deep Blue Sea</p></a></nav><div class=\"mt-12 p-6 bg-primary/5 rounded-2xl border border-primary/10 text-center\"><p class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">🐾 Ready to find the perfect animal name?</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Browse our complete collection of